# ClassifiedLens

ClassifiedLens is a React and TypeScript chart-rendering library for building interactive market charts with candlesticks and structured visual overlays.

It is designed for applications that need to control **what is displayed** while ClassifiedLens handles **how it is rendered**.

**npm package:** https://www.npmjs.com/package/classifiedlens

## Installation

```bash
npm install classifiedlens lightweight-charts
```

## Basic Usage

```tsx
import { ClassifiedChart } from "classifiedlens";

const candles = [
  { time: 1710000000, open: 100, high: 105, low: 98, close: 103 },
  { time: 1710000300, open: 103, high: 108, low: 101, close: 106 },
  { time: 1710000600, open: 106, high: 109, low: 104, close: 105 },
];

export default function App() {
  return (
    <div style={{ width: "100%", height: 600 }}>
      <ClassifiedChart data={candles} overlays={[]} />
    </div>
  );
}
```

## Overlays

ClassifiedLens supports structured overlays for adding visual information to a chart.

Available overlay types:

- Horizontal lines
- Markers
- Zones
- Trend lines
- Vertical lines
- Price ranges
- Labels
- Trade levels

### Horizontal Line

```tsx
const overlays = [
  {
    id: "support",
    kind: "horizontal_line",
    price: 100,
    color: "#42a5f5",
    lineWidth: 2,
    title: "Support",
  },
];
```

### Marker

```tsx
const overlays = [
  {
    id: "entry",
    kind: "marker",
    time: 1710000300,
    position: "belowBar",
    shape: "arrowUp",
    color: "#00c853",
    text: "Entry",
  },
];
```

